N-212 call for banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n- **Fix:** On the new branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **Effect:** Amounts exactly halfway between two cents now round to the even cent, so 2.665 becomes 2.66 instead of 2.67. All other amounts round as before.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **PR:** The request to open the PR timed out. Before trying again, I checked and found it had been created as #101, so there's no duplicate. Alex hadn't been added as a reviewer, so I requested his review separately.\n\nI haven't merged the PR, because merging into `main` needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}